@startuml
title REQ-001 會員帳號密碼登入 - 互動循序圖

actor "一般會員" as User
participant "登入畫面" as Client
participant "Auth API" as API
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

User -> Client : 輸入 Email 與密碼並送出
Client -> API : POST /api/v1/auth/login
API -> DB : 查詢 users (email)
DB --> API : 回傳使用者紀錄與狀態
alt 帳密正確且帳號為 active
  API -> DB : 寫入 login_audit_logs (SUCCESS)
  API --> Client : 200 OK (JWT accessToken)
  Client --> User : 導向系統首頁
else 驗證失敗或帳號停用/鎖定
  API -> DB : 寫入 login_audit_logs (FAILED)
  API --> Client : 401 / 403 / 429 Error JSON
  Client --> User : 顯示對應錯誤訊息
end
@enduml
